# Chroma library, modern Earth: OUTSIDE EVENTS read through the person's filter (across stages). Plan: earth-plan.md "Across stages".
# Syntax: header of build.py. Five readings each, one per color; over the file each color's joys minus troubles must net out equal.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- joys

== a festival comes to town
tier: read
source: community
tone: joy
base: need:belonging+.15 need:meaning+.05
earth: the summer festival fills the square with music, stalls and lights
times: once or twice a year
window: 12-110
gap: 0.5-1
likelier: small towns, warm seasons, peace and plenty, a strong local culture
rarer: war, a big anonymous city, hard times that cancel it
scene: Bunting goes up across the square, the smell of frying onions drifts over the rooftops, and a brass band is tuning up somewhere near the church.
- W | a time for the whole town to come together, as it should | impact: 1.0 | say: {N} helps carry tables for the church stall and stays on to serve tea.
- U | a chance to see how the town really works, stall by stall | impact: 0.8 | say: {N} wanders the stalls, asking the makers how they do it.
- B | a crowd with money in its pockets and a few useful faces in it | impact: 0.9 | also: belonging+.03 | say: {N} works the crowd all day, selling a little and making useful friends.
- R | music, food and dancing until the lights go out | impact: 1.3 | also: belonging+.03 | say: {N} dances in the square until the band packs up.
- G | the old summer feast, the same as every year anyone remembers | impact: 0.9 | say: {N} sits with the old ones under the lime tree, watching the children run.

== praise from a stranger
tier: read
source: daily life
tone: joy
base: need:competence+.1 need:belonging+.05
earth: a stranger stops you to say they admire something you made, the way you handled your child, or your singing
times: a few times a year
window: 12-110
gap: 0.2-2
likelier: work done in public, a craft or a voice people notice, friendly places
rarer: work done out of sight, cold and hurried cities
scene: A woman in the queue taps {N} on the shoulder: she heard {N} sing at the wedding last week, and she has not stopped thinking about it.
- W | it is good to know the work was done well | impact: 0.9 | also: competence+.05 | say: {N} thanks her warmly and walks home a little straighter.
- U | what exactly did they notice? there may be something to learn | impact: 0.8 | also: competence+.05 | say: {N} asks her what struck her most, and listens closely.
- B | proof of what the work is worth, and worth making use of | impact: 1.0 | also: autonomy+.05 | say: {N} asks her to say it again in front of the people who matter.
- R | a glow that lasts all day | impact: 1.3 | also: competence+.05 | say: {N} grins all the way home and tells everyone at dinner.
- G | kind words, taken lightly, like sun on the face | impact: 0.8 | say: {N} smiles, nods, and lets the words settle.

== an unexpected refund or prize
tier: read
source: institution
tone: joy
base: need:safety+.15 res:money+.05
earth: a tax refund, a premium bond or a raffle prize arrives out of the blue
times: once every few years
window: 16-110
gap: 2-8
likelier: a tax system that pays back, a habit of entering draws
rarer: no paperwork in the person's name, cash-only lives
scene: For once the letter is not a bill. Inside is a cheque from the tax office, with an apology for the delay.
- W | set it aside for the family's needs and the next rainy day | impact: 0.9 | say: {N} puts it straight into the savings account, every penny.
- U | work out the smartest thing it could become | impact: 0.9 | also: competence+.05 | say: {N} sits down with a pencil and works out three plans for it.
- B | seed money; make it grow | impact: 1.1 | also: autonomy+.05 | say: {N} puts it into a deal that same week.
- R | a gift from nowhere; spend it on something wonderful | impact: 1.2 | say: {N} books a weekend away before the cheque has cleared.
- G | a good season; share it round | impact: 0.9 | also: belonging+.05 | say: {N} takes the whole family out for a long Sunday lunch.

== a wedding invitation from near strangers
tier: read
source: community
tone: joy
base: need:belonging+.1
earth: a thick envelope arrives: the wedding of a colleague's daughter or a cousin's friend, with your name on it
times: once every few years
window: 14-110
gap: 1-6
likelier: a large family, a small town, a workplace where everyone knows everyone
rarer: few ties, a big city, a family that has drifted apart
scene: A thick cream envelope lies on the mat with {Ns} name in gold ink. {N} has to read the names twice to work out who is getting married.
- W | they thought of us; it would be rude not to go and bring a proper gift | impact: 1.0 | say: {N} replies by return of post and buys something from the list.
- U | why were we invited? work out the connection | impact: 0.7 | say: {N} traces the link through three cousins and an old neighbour.
- B | a room full of people worth meeting | impact: 0.9 | say: {N} goes, and comes home with four new numbers in the phone.
- R | a free party, and a dance floor | impact: 1.3 | also: belonging+.05 | say: {N} dances with the bride's grandmother and is the last one off the floor.
- G | the circle of people is wider than you knew | impact: 0.9 | also: meaning+.05 | say: {N} sits near the back and finds a distant cousin at the next table.

== a relative's success
tier: read
source: community
tone: joy
base: need:belonging+.1 need:meaning+.05
earth: a sibling gets the top job, a cousin is on the news, a niece wins a place at a famous university
times: once every few years
window: 12-110
gap: 1-5
likelier: a large family, ambitious relatives, good times
rarer: a small or scattered family, hard times
scene: {sibling} rings with the news, breathless: the promotion came through, and it is the top job.
- W | an honour for the whole family | impact: 1.1 | also: meaning+.05 | say: {N} tells everyone who will listen and asks for a family dinner in {sibling}'s honour.
- U | how did they do it? | impact: 0.8 | say: {N} asks {sibling} to walk through every step of it.
- B | a sting of envy, then a thought: a relative in a high place is worth having | impact: 0.8 | also: safety+.05 | say: {N} congratulates {sibling}, and makes a note to call more often.
- R | pure joy and a little envy, all at once | impact: 1.2 | also: competence-.05 | say: {N} whoops down the phone, then sits very still for a while afterwards.
- G | the family tree bears good fruit | impact: 0.9 | also: belonging+.05 | say: {N} calls {parent} at once, so the news travels the old way.

== the neighbours are doing well
tier: read
source: community
tone: joy
base: need:belonging+.05 need:meaning+.05
earth: the neighbours' shop takes off, a new car sits in their drive, their son gets into medical school
times: once every few years
window: 12-110
gap: 1-6
likelier: a rising neighbourhood, good times, a street where people talk
rarer: a declining street, hard times, neighbours who keep to themselves
scene: A new car in the neighbours' drive, a skip full of their old kitchen, and a banner in their window: the shop is opening a second branch.
- W | good for the street; everyone rises together | impact: 1.0 | say: {N} brings round a card and a cake.
- U | what did they do differently? | impact: 0.8 | also: competence+.05 | say: {N} asks over the fence how they got it going, and takes notes.
- B | if they can do it, so can I, and better | impact: 0.8 | also: autonomy+.05 competence-.05 | say: {N} looks at the new car for a long moment and starts making plans.
- R | glad for them, and itching to do something big too | impact: 1.1 | say: {N} cheers loudest at their opening, then lies awake restless.
- G | every garden has its season; theirs is now | impact: 0.9 | also: meaning+.05 | say: {N} waves over the hedge and goes back to the roses.

== the new thing everyone is talking about
tier: read
source: daily life
tone: joy
base: need:autonomy+.1 need:competence+.05
