window: 12-110
gap: 2-8
likelier: a person from a group or place seldom shown; a lively press
rarer: a group always in the news; a closed press
scene: On the evening news there is a story about someone from {Ns} kind of town and {Ns} kind of family, and they tell it with respect.
- W | proof that people like us are a proper part of the country | impact: 1.0 | say: {N} records it and makes the whole family watch.
- U | at last someone told it accurately | impact: 0.9 | say: {N} looks up the reporter and reads everything they have written.
- B | if they can make it, so can I | impact: 1.0 | also: autonomy+.05 | say: {N} watches it twice and starts drafting a plan.
- R | tears, right there on the sofa | impact: 1.2 | also: belonging+.05 | say: {N} cries on the sofa and rings a friend the moment it ends.
- G | our people, our place, seen at last | impact: 0.9 | also: meaning+.05 | say: {N} cuts the article out and pins it by the door.

== the sun goes dark at noon
tier: read
source: cosmology
tone: joy
base: need:meaning+.15
earth: a total eclipse of the sun passes over the region, and the sky goes dark at midday
times: once or twice in a life
window: 12-110
gap: 10-60
likelier: a clear sky, a path of totality nearby, a chance to travel to it
rarer: cloud, a place far from the path
scene: At eleven minutes past noon the birds go quiet, the air turns cold, and the sun becomes a dark hole ringed with silver fire.
- W | a moment to feel how small we are, and give thanks | impact: 1.0 | also: meaning+.05 | say: {N} stands with the neighbours in the field, silent, hands joined.
- U | the clockwork of the sky, exactly on time | impact: 1.2 | say: {N} has the filters, the timings and a notebook ready.
- B | a crowd of visitors who need parking, glasses and a view | impact: 0.6 | say: {N} sells eclipse glasses to the visitors at twice the price.
- R | a shiver through the whole body | impact: 1.3 | also: meaning+.05 | say: {N} shouts out loud as the light goes, and then laughs.
- G | the old sky doing its old turn, as it did for the ancestors | impact: 1.0 | also: meaning+.05 | say: {N} lies back in the grass and watches it the way people always have.

== the home team wins the cup
tier: read
source: community
tone: joy
base: need:belonging+.15
