times: once or twice a decade, often less
window: 12-110
gap: 5-30
likelier: a town with one club everyone follows, a good season
rarer: a big city with many clubs, a person who never follows sport
scene: The final whistle goes and the whole street erupts: car horns, strangers hugging, someone crying into a scarf.
- W | the town's day, and everyone shares in it | impact: 1.0 | say: {N} lines the route for the open-top bus with the rest of the street.
- U | a strange thing, how a whole town can feel one feeling | impact: 0.7 | say: {N} watches the crowd more than the match.
- B | a winners' town, and a good week for business | impact: 0.8 | say: {N} buys scarves cheap and is selling them to the crowd by Tuesday.
- R | the best night in years | impact: 1.4 | also: belonging+.1 | say: {N} sings in the fountain with strangers until long after dark.
- G | the old club, the old songs, our people | impact: 1.0 | also: meaning+.05 | say: {N} digs out {grandparent}'s old scarf and wears it to the parade.

== a snow day
tier: read
source: environment
tone: joy
base: need:autonomy+.1 need:belonging+.05
earth: heavy snow overnight closes schools, roads and offices, and the town goes quiet and white
times: once every year or few, where winters bring snow
window: 12-110
gap: 1-5
likelier: cold winters, hills, a small town
rarer: warm climates, a warming world
scene: {N} wakes to a strange, thick silence. Outside everything is covered, and the radio is reading out the list of schools that are closed.
- W | clear the paths and check on the old neighbours | impact: 0.9 | say: {N} shovels the whole row of front paths before breakfast.
- U | look at the drifts, the tracks and the patterns the wind left | impact: 0.9 | say: {N} measures the snow on the garden table and photographs the crystals.
- B | everyone is stuck; a good day to get ahead while they are not | impact: 0.8 | also: competence+.05 | say: {N} works from the kitchen table and finishes what the others will not.
- R | a free day in a new world | impact: 1.3 | also: autonomy+.05 | say: {N} is out with a sledge before anyone else is dressed.
- G | the world has stopped to rest; rest with it | impact: 1.0 | also: meaning+.05 | say: {N} lights the fire, puts soup on, and watches it fall.

